// Title: Remote CHM File Download/Execution Via HH.EXE
// Rule ID: f57c58b3-ee69-4ef5-9041-455bf39aaa89
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
